# LED Mapper provisioning — never commit deploy secrets.
#
# The deploy SSH key pair lives here (generated by scripts/manage_keys.sh).
# The PUBLIC half is baked into the image at build time; the PRIVATE half is
# used for live redeploys. Neither is committed — the key is per-operator and
# rotatable. See README.md "SSH key management".
# Ignore the key material inside secrets/, but keep the directory's README
# tracked. (`secrets/` excludes the directory itself, after which git can't
# re-include a file under it — so match the contents with `secrets/*`.)
secrets/*
!secrets/README.md

# Nix build artifacts / result symlinks if anyone builds in-tree.
result
result-*
/tmp/ledmapper-sdimage
